hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18946","Waki narrated to us, Ismail ibn Ibrahim, meaning Ibn Muhajir, narrated to me, from Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr, from Said ibn Hurayth, brother of Amr ibn Hurayth, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Whoever sells a house or property and does not put its price into something like it is likely not to be blessed therein."
